# Copied to <space-clone>/.dockerignore by spaces/api/sync.sh.
#
# The Space repo is already a curated subset, so this is only about keeping
# caches, local state and credentials out of the build context — and out of the
# image layers, which are readable by anyone who can pull the Space.

.git
.gitattributes
DEPLOY.md

# Python caches / virtualenvs
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/*.egg-info
**/.venv
**/venv

# Runtime state. agrotech.db holds farmer PII; uploads are user-submitted.
# Neither may ever be baked into a layer.
**/*.db
**/*.db-wal
**/*.db-shm
**/*.sqlite
**/*.sqlite3
ml-service/uploads

# Secrets arrive as Space secrets at runtime, never from the build context.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/credentials.json

**/.DS_Store
